    "text": "My Ref. No.: KDS/TUM/4/1/6/13. Ministry of Land Reference No.: 4-3/7/2020/HW/60. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:",
