    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired: Undermentioned land shown in Block No. 01 Sheet No. 1, in the Surveyor General\u2019s plan of CM 321290 situated in the Village of Barandara in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 322 Barandara, in Thumpane Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Kandy District of Central Province.",
