      55.58,
      115.83,
      294.4,
      222.16
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Thumpane on the 28th of April 2025, at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st of April 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for computation for the said land/servitude the amount of compensation the details of the computation of such amount.",
